From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Modrinth Enhanced <patches@modrinth-enhanced.invalid>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 10:17:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Use the Modrinth Enhanced icon

Replaces the bundled application icons with the Modrinth mark plus a
sparkle badge that marks the build as the enhanced fork. The vector
source the whole set is rendered from is checked in next to the
generated files as `modrinth-enhanced.svg`.

`icons/apple.icon` is left untouched: it is an Icon Composer source
that nothing in the build references.
